The comment texts, EDH ids, datings and the Trismegistos and EDCS links come
from the Epigraphic Database Heidelberg (https://edh.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/),
licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. Changes: the inscriptions with a commentary were
selected and reduced to id, commentary and dating (not_before, not_after) in
data/corpus/edh_comments.json; the Trismegistos and EDCS links are given only
for the 1100 annotated comments (data/goldstandard/inscription_identifiers.csv).

The Latin search terms follow the image descriptions of the Epigraphic
Database Bari (EDB, https://www.edb.uniba.it/). The Iconclass notations refer
to Iconclass (https://iconclass.org/), the alignment to the EAGLE vocabulary
"Decoration" (https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/decor.html).

